TITLE Built-in Calcite kinetics; SI(Witherite) at reaction step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 30 charge
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 10 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -si Witherite
END
